		<description>A hermetically sealed canister containing HPserum, a substance filled with specialized mechanites that upon contact with any wound repair them in seconds. This economic version uses cheap materials at cost of a lower potency, cannot heal scars, lost limbs or diseases. HP Serum can be loaded inside some weapons \n<color #cbff52>Gameplay effect:</color> \nWeapons using this serum reduces their base healing to 85% of its value</description>
		<descriptionHyperlinks>
            <ThingDef>CH_MedicGun_Rifle</ThingDef>
            <ThingDef>CH_MedicGun_SMG</ThingDef>   
            <ThingDef>CH_MedicGun_MechRifle</ThingDef>   
        </descriptionHyperlinks>
		<graphicData>
			<texPath>Things/Item/hpsubstance_basic</texPath>
			<graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
		</graphicData>
		<soundInteract>Metal_Drop</soundInteract>
		<soundDrop>Standard_Drop</soundDrop>
		<category>Item</category>
		<stackLimit>10</stackLimit>
		<statBases>
			<MaxHitPoints>60</MaxHitPoints>
			<MarketValue>140</MarketValue>
			<Mass>0.6</Mass>
			<Flammability>0.6</Flammability>
			<DeteriorationRate>2.0</DeteriorationRate>
		</statBases>
		<techLevel>Industrial</techLevel>
		<thingCategories>
			<li>Manufactured</li>
		</thingCategories>
		<tradeTags>
			<li>Drugs</li>
		</tradeTags>
		<thingSetMakerTags>
    		<li>RewardStandardMidFreq</li>
